Z||000025||Slammed Fiero||10-09-2001||07:38 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Oreif:<BR><B> Slammed Fiero, Archie Just sold the car again last year. He bought it back and added the hood vents then repainted it. I think he did some other work on it also. It doesn't have NOS now. Not sure if it had it before. Archie drove it around last summer until he sold it.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hmmm.. Now I thought the imsa car in the pictures above (the coloured pics of the imsa car with the TSW blades) was a customer car of archie. It has a Tpi zz4 in it, the zz4 is a fairly new engine.<P>The video I have shows a car that has a carb'd small block in it?<P>Where is archie? he can clear this up. I believe it's 2 different cars though. IF you look on Archies customer pages I believe the white imsa pictured at the start of this thread is shown (same car??)<P>JM <P>||||reg||1
